on mouseLeave
  [  0] pushint8 106 ............................ <106>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <106>
  [  5] extcall 4 ............................... <sprite(106)>
  [  7] pushcons 0 .............................. <"ok">
  [  9] pusharglist 1 ........................... <"ok">
  [ 11] extcall 16 .............................. <cast("ok")>
  [ 13] setobjprop 17 ........................... sprite(106).member = cast("ok")
  [ 15] ret
end

on mouseUp
